---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Consulting
description: "Advisory, technical diagnostics, project delivery and fractional architecture for enterprise data and AI platforms."
permalink: /consulting/
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
<section class="border-b border-rule py-16 sm:py-20">
  <div class="u-shell u-manuscript">
    <p class="u-eyebrow lg:pt-2">Consulting</p>
    <div>
      <h1 class="u-display max-w-3xl text-section">Start a project, or borrow the judgement to scope one.</h1>
      <p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-[1.02rem] leading-relaxed text-ink-2">{{ consulting.intro }}</p>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-[0.95rem] leading-relaxed text-ink-3">{{ consulting.positioning }}</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# ------------------------------------------------------------ Services -- #}
<section class="border-b border-rule py-16 sm:py-20">
  <div class="u-shell u-manuscript">
    <p class="u-eyebrow lg:pt-1.5">Engagements</p>
    <div>
      <h2 class="u-display mb-8 max-w-2xl text-section">Four ways in.</h2>
      <ol class="space-y-px">
        {% for s in consulting.services %}
          <li class="border border-rule p-6 sm:p-7">
            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-x-6 gap-y-1">
              <p class="u-eyebrow">{{ "0" }}{{ loop.index }}</p>
              <span class="border border-rule px-1.5 py-px font-mono text-[0.62rem] uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-ink-3">{{ s.basis }}</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="u-display mt-2 text-[1.35rem] text-ink">{{ s.name }}</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 max-w-2xl text-[0.98rem] text-ink">{{ s.summary }}</p>
            <p class="mt-3 max-w-2xl text-[0.95rem] leading-relaxed text-ink-2">{{ s.body }}</p>

            <ul class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-x-6 gap-y-1.5">
              {% for d in s.deliverables %}
                <li class="u-meta">· {{ d }}</li>
              {% endfor %}
            </ul>

            <div class="mt-5">
              {% if s.rate %}
                <p class="u-verified text-[1.1rem]">{{ s.rate }}</p>
              {% else %}
                {% set phLabel = "Rate for " + s.name | lower %}
                {% set phNote = "Priced per engagement — ask" %}
                {% include "partials/placeholder.njk" %}
              {% endif %}
            </div>
          </li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ol>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# ------------------------------------------------------------- Process -- #}
<section class="border-b border-rule bg-surface-2/40 py-16 sm:py-20">
  <div class="u-shell u-manuscript">
    <p class="u-eyebrow lg:pt-1.5">Process</p>
    <div>
      <h2 class="u-display mb-8 max-w-2xl text-section">Three steps, and you can stop after any of them.</h2>
      <ol class="divide-y divide-rule border-y border-rule">
        {% for p in consulting.process %}
          <li class="grid gap-x-8 gap-y-2 py-5 lg:grid-cols-[5rem_minmax(0,1fr)]">
            <span class="u-eyebrow lg:pt-1">{{ p.step }}</span>
            <span>
              <span class="block text-[1.02rem] text-ink">{{ p.name }}</span>
              <span class="mt-1 block max-w-2xl text-[0.95rem] leading-relaxed text-ink-2">{{ p.body }}</span>
            </span>
          </li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ol>

      <div class="mt-8">
        {% if consulting.availability %}
          <p class="u-meta">{{ consulting.availability }}</p>
        {% else %}
          {% set phLabel = "Current availability" %}
          {% set phNote = "Add earliest start date and capacity" %}
          {% include "partials/placeholder.njk" %}
        {% endif %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# ------------------------------------------------------------- Contact -- #}
<section class="border-b border-rule bg-ink py-16 text-surface sm:py-20">
  <div class="u-shell">
    <p class="u-eyebrow !text-surface/45">Start here</p>
    <h2 class="u-display mt-4 max-w-3xl text-[clamp(1.7rem,4vw,2.9rem)]">
      Tell me the problem <span class="text-surface/50">before</span> the solution you had in mind.
    </h2>
    <p class="mt-5 max-w-2xl text-[0.98rem] leading-relaxed text-surface/70">
      An email with the shape of the problem, the stack you are on and roughly when you need
      it is enough to work out whether a call is worth either of our time.
    </p>
    <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-8 gap-y-3">
      <a href="mailto:{{ site.author.email }}?subject=Consulting%20enquiry" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 border border-surface bg-surface px-5 py-2.5 font-mono text-[0.76rem] uppercase tracking-[0.09em] text-ink transition-opacity hover:opacity-85">{{ site.author.email }}</a>
      {% for s in site.social %}
        {% if s.name == "LinkedIn" %}
          <a href="{{ s.url }}" rel="me noopener" class="font-mono text-[0.78rem] text-surface/75 underline decoration-surface/30 underline-offset-4 transition-colors hover:text-surface">LinkedIn ↗</a>
        {% endif %}
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
